<div style="text-align: center;">
<blockquote>
<p><span style="font-size:110%;">This situation has only been made worse with the addition of yet more bees!</span></p>
</blockquote>
</div>
<hr />
<p>After an&#8230; interesting start to Corpsecon, I finally have an article that I'm proud to enter. The development of this article also coincided with a completely separate joke about bees that managed to worm its way in here, so that's fun as well. Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ch00bakka" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1238719); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1238719&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1598066982" alt="ch00bakka" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1238719)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ch00bakka" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1238719); return false;">ch00bakka</a></span> for giving me such amazing conprocs, especially after what I received before.</p>
<p>All three quotes were created and modified from existing sections of religious texts (as attributed in the article) and are public domain</p>
<p>Huge thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/spicaterrible" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1530394); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1530394&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1598066982" alt="spicaterrible" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1530394)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/spicaterrible" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1530394); return false;">spicaterrible</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aethris" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5158506); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5158506&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1598066982" alt="Aethris" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5158506)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aethris" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5158506); return false;">Aethris</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elunerazim" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5226742); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5226742&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1598066982" alt="Elunerazim" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5226742)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elunerazim" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5226742); return false;">Elunerazim</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2199269); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2199269&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1598066982" alt="Yossipossi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2199269)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info